  "summary": "Two blockers. UsernameForm.java:47 calls a no-arg `isConditionalPasskeysEnabled()` that doesn't exist, so the module won't compile. The new helper also requires `user != null`, which removes passkey setup from the anonymous login page, where it ran before. The remaining changes and the tests look reasonable.",
